      "answer": "Your gold is confirmed from campaign state: **25 gold** (Eval Hero, Banner Spear). Here's everything available at Prosperity 1 (items 001–016), split by what you can and can't afford:\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Affordable (25 gold or less)\n\n| # | Name | Slot | Cost | Effect |\n|---|------|------|------|--------|\n| 001 | Weathered Boots | Legs | 15g | During your move ability, add *Move +1*. |\n| 002 | Winged Shoes | Legs | 15g | During your turn, add *Jump* to all your move abilities. |\n| 003 | Hide Armor | Body | 10g | On the next two attack sources targeting you, gain *Shield 1* for those attacks. |\n| 004 | Leather Armor | Body | 10g | When attacked, the attacker gains *disadvantage* before drawing a modifier card. |\n| 005 | Scouting Lens | Head | 10g | During your attack ability, add *Pierce 1* to one attack. |\n| 006 | Amulet of Life | Head | 15g | During your turn, perform *Heal 1, Self*. |\n| 007 | Poison Dagger | One Hand | 15g | During your melee attack ability, add *Poison* to one attack. |\n| 008 | Heater Shield | One Hand | 15g | When you suffer damage from an attack, gain *Shield 1* for that attack. |\n| 009 | Focusing Rod | One Hand | 10g | During your turn, if you've performed a *Lost* action, perform *Heal 1, Range 3*. |\n| 010 | Simple Bow | Two Hands | 15g | During your ranged attack ability, gain *advantage* on one attack. |\n| 011 | Healing Potion | Small Item | 10g | During your turn, perform *Heal 3, Self*. |\n| 012 | Stamina Potion | Small Item | 10g | During your turn, recover one level 1 card from your discard pile. |\n| 013 | Element Potion | Small Item | 10g | During your turn, *Wild* (infuse a wild element). |\n\n---\n\n## ❌ Too Expensive (cost exceeds 25g)\n\n| # | Name | Slot | Cost |\n|---|------|------|------|\n| 014 | Studded Leather | Body | 20g |\n| 015 | Comfortable Shoes | Legs | 20g |\n| 016 | Circlet of Elements | Head | 20g |\n\n---\n\n**Wait — items 014–016 are only 20g**, which is actually **under** your 25g budget